{"schemaVersion":2,"unitHash":"58d50e7224d647d0bc53338d01afc44e7c5763ad1ae2ae2dd0fc5528623dab5b","name":"README.md","kind":"program","lines":13,"source":"# `kona-mpt`\n\nA recursive, in-memory implementation of Ethereum's hexary Merkle Patricia Trie (MPT), supporting:\n- Retrieval\n- Insertion\n- Deletion\n- Root Computation\n    - Trie Node RLP Encoding\n\nThis implementation is intended to serve as a backend for a stateless executor of Ethereum blocks, like\nthe one in the [`kona-executor`](../executor) crate. Starting with a trie root, the `TrieNode` can be\nunravelled to access, insert, or delete values. These operations are all backed by the `TrieProvider`,\nwhich enables fetching the preimages of hashed trie nodes.","resolutions":{"9fa846564f4071bd":{"status":"differs","coveredLines":13,"match":{"origin":"own","collection":"optimism","relation":{"type":"own"},"rank":0,"matchedBy":"name","auditedName":"README.md","similarity":0.846,"reportId":"optimism/cantina-kona-2026-03","repository":"op-rs/kona","path":"crates/proof/mpt/README.md","commit":"86910c9112437bbb849eca28961f813c5450e103","commitTimestamp":"2025-12-15T17:17:05Z","url":"https://github.com/op-rs/kona/blob/86910c9112437bbb849eca28961f813c5450e103/crates/proof/mpt/README.md","auditStatus":"audited_with_no_major_findings","reviewPhase":"initial audit","coverage":"Directory listed in full in the report's scope tree (all files beneath it) for the Cantina review of kona at 86910c91 (Jan 19 - Feb 9, 2026). Merkle Patricia trie crate; Informational finding 3.5.2 (node.rs) located here.","majorFindings":0,"isLatestVersion":true,"laterAuditedVersionExists":false,"totalVersions":1},"diff":{"added":0,"removed":4,"ignoredAdded":0,"ignoredRemoved":1,"unchanged":13,"ignoredOnly":false,"hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":10,"newStart":1,"newLines":5,"lines":[{"type":" ","oldLine":1,"newLine":1,"text":"# `kona-mpt`"},{"type":" ","oldLine":2,"newLine":2,"text":""},{"type":"-","oldLine":3,"text":"<a href=\"https://githu